  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%82%B4%EA%B2%8C-%EB%B3%95%EC%9D%B4-%EB%8B%BF%EC%A7%80-%EC%95%8A%EC%95%84%EB%8F%84/2928), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60582714)\n\nMiro and Euro are three-year-old sisters.\n\nAs a child of the main character in a big drama, Euro was an actor who gave surprises by performing uncharacteristically childish acting.\n\nMiro, on the other hand, has a different appearance and personality than Euro.\n\nShe was just an ordinary little girl.\n\nMiro likes her older sister, Euro, but sometimes hates her because she has been compared to her since she was born.\n\nWhen I was separated from my parents due to my parents' divorce when I was in the upper grades of elementary school, I felt relieved as well as sad.\n\nThe two naturally drifted apart, but Euro never forgets to contact Miro no matter how busy he is.\n\nAbout two years after the divorce, Miro's mother remarried to a man with a child.\n\nMiro sees the boy (Yoon Woo) at the meeting and thinks that he is really big.\n\nYun Woo was the same age as Euro, but he was tall for a middle school student, and the hand he reached out to shake hands with was very tall. If you ask me when I started liking you, I should probably say from the beginning. You may have been overwhelmed by that feeling from the beginning.",
